025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_wwr_TwoThousandThirteenOmnibusIncentivePlanMember_YiBQp8FABE2yQwaCMSH9Ug" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_M4xnYunERUekqyaiB7RELg">20,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares on May 27, 2025.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">Under the 2013 Plan, the Company may grant awards of stock options, stock appreciation rights, restricted stock awards, RSUs, unrestricted stock, dividend equivalent rights, performance shares and other performance-based awards, other equity-based awards and cash bonus awards to eligible persons. Equity awards under the 2013 Plan are granted from time to time at the discretion of the Compensation Committee of the Board (the &#8220;Committee&#8221;), with vesting periods and other terms as determined by the Committee with a maximum term of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_wwr_TwoThousandThirteenOmnibusIncentivePlanMember_uXS_k6HXHEyPG58Xh1MaGQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_PPhKu8gaS0WaadLLMU9JlQ">10 years</ix:nonNumeric>. The 2013 Plan is administered by the Committee, which can delegate the administration to the Board, other committees or to such other officers and employees of the Company as designated by the Committee and permitted by the 2013 Plan. &#160;As of December&#160;31,&#160;2025, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Q07RaiXFgEO02uoDaOpmoA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_wwr_TwoThousandThirteenOmnibusIncentivePlanMember_h08axVIjrUWxTs26apAYEg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_MisUjJj0_EyEm05SdbLISw">48,281</ix:nonFraction> shares were available for future issuances under the 2013 Plan. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">The Inducement Plan provides for the grant of equity-based awards, including RSU&#8217;s, restricted stock, performance shares and performance units. &#160;Under the Inducement Plan, the Company may grant equity awards for the sole purpose of recruiting and hiring new employees. &#160;As of December 31, 2024, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Q07RaiXFgEO02uoDaOpmoA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_wwr_InducementPlanMember_SqyjU_18DEOHligrUKw42A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_04eDn4aMgUq9PReiL4OWmg">114,429</ix:nonFraction> shares were available for future issuances under the Inducement Plan.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">For years ended December&#160;31,&#160;2025 and 2024, the Company recorded stock-based compensation expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Ymkz3xLW9kKn2bkJOHt_fQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeStatementLocationAxis_us-gaap_GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_wwr_TwoThousandThirteenOmnibusIncentivePlanMember_JkKmTW64U0yVeIotM