 performance. As a result, the Company has entered into agreements to sell a portion of its raw material inventory. Sales of raw material inventory are recognized upon shipment. Because the Kellyton Graphite Plant is not currently operational and these agreements are not entered into in the Company&#8217;s ordinary course of business activities, the Company does not recognize these agreements as revenue under ASC 606, &#8220;<i style="font-style:italic;">Revenue from Contracts with Customers&#8221;</i>. &#160;For the year ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 the Company recognized sales of raw material inventory of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Ymkz3xLW9kKn2bkJOHt_fQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_1eoApR8Oy0eZ-XHbZvqCoA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wwr:IncomeFromSaleOfRawMaterialInventory" scale="6" id="Narr_l80QiCiIekKpZ3nJxcJPUw">0.3</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Ymkz3xLW9kKn2bkJOHt_fQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_C8pJfLPVxEeGfotaF_myCw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wwr:IncomeFromSaleOfRawMaterialInventory" scale="6" id="Narr_VbjTYdW7mkOW4cV0b6-PwA">3.6</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively, and related offsetting expenses of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Ymkz3xLW9kKn2bkJOHt_fQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_1eoApR8Oy0eZ-XHbZvqCoA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wwr:CostOfSaleOfRawMaterialInventory" scale="6" id="Narr_Vrvjrw7USkmtG0ZwiSy9WA">0.3</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Ymkz3xLW9kKn2bkJOHt_fQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_C8pJfLPVxEeGfotaF_myCw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wwr:CostOfSaleOfRawMaterialInventory" scale="6" id="Narr_kfS6QktjwES21GDPW-gdWg">4.1</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="v