 Company continues to record a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_EjdbpLAyAES3mel_C-Ie4g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_1eoApR8Oy0eZ-XHbZvqCoA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wwr:EffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationDeferredTaxAssetsValuationAllowancePercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_M6e8upQnWEu_io1jgRDqJw">100</ix:nonFraction>% valuation against the net deferred tax assets.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">At December 31, 2025, the Company had U.S. NOLs of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Ymkz3xLW9kKn2bkJOHt_fQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_StatementGeographicalAxis_country_US_38t-8o-gQUmnwdYyq-Lkew" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards" scale="6" id="Narr_M2lb1hDncUGBO-1_Yz8NAg">284.0</ix:nonFraction> million which expire from <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_srt_StatementGeographicalAxis_country_US_wZEEN-TL-Eqd0nuSiaWQtQ" name="wwr:OperatingLossCarryforwardsExpirationYear" id="Narr_LrTPWD0eFEqYTvCHQvPbZA">2026</ix:nonNumeric> to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_srt_StatementGeographicalAxis_country_US_U-dUEqfYPUyiEropPtS1mw" name="wwr:OperatingLossCarryforwardsExpirationYear" id="Narr_NiRMShisIUyKPPDrouPSvA">indefinite availability</ix:nonNumeric>. &#160;As a result of the Tax Cuts and Jobs Act of 2017, U.S. NOLs generated in years ending after 2017 have an indefinite carryforward rather than the previous <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_RestatementAxis_srt_ScenarioPreviouslyReportedMember_vMJR-p-i90qpV29DPzFBAQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="wwr:OperatingLossCarryforwardPeriod" id="Narr_Pnr1FQMh70SoiNM5mVmdnw">20-year</ix:nonNumeric> carryforward. &#160;This does not impact losses incurred in years ended i